    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so if you think the privilege side is the \"most legally sound\" one, does that mean the counter-argument about checks and balances is basically just a weak or outdated argument? like, is there even a real legal basis for saying it's an \"erosion\" if the presidency needs it that badly?",
